# gray

--- DoorMan_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_DOOR_MAN_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Gray opens a new pair of portals that shields him and allies for <VALUE2> when they pass through.
now  Gray opens a new pair of portals that shields him and allies for 1000 when they pass through.
  VALUE2  1000  -> 1000

--- DoorMan_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_DOORMAN_1_DESC
raw  When Gray has full health, the next damage taken is reduced by <VALUE>%.
now  When Gray has full health, the next damage taken is reduced by 50%.
  VALUE  50  -> 50

--- DoorMan_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_DOORMAN_2_DESC
raw  When Gray or his Allies use Doors, they recover <VALUE>% of their max hit points.
now  When Gray or his Allies use Doors, they recover 20% of their max hit points.
  VALUE  20  -> 20
